  "description": "SkyWebFramework.Utilities is an all-in-one helper library that eliminates boilerplate code and provides battle-tested extension methods for common .NET operations. Includes string manipulation (truncate, slugify, sanitize), date utilities (business days, age calculation, time ago), collection helpers (batch processing, safe operations), security tools (hashing, encryption, GUID generation), math utilities (percentage, rounding, range checks), and object manipulation (deep clone, mapping, null checks). Perfect for web applications, APIs, microservices, and enterprise systems.",
